Indian male, middle-aged, traditional royal attire with gold embroidered robes, red and white turban, silver ornaments, performing funeral rites as conspiracy and betrayal by courtiers close in, oil painting in the style of Raja Ravi Varma, rich pigments, soft chiaroscuro, reverent, ancient Puranic-era palace courtyard of low carved-stone and timber buildings, clay-tile roofs, grey smoky light, wide horizontal composition with the subject left of centre and open space on the right, a purely visual image, every surface plain and unmarked.